ots 1
# demo-menu: select Demo on the title menu and watch 60 s of it.
# Authored against ot-ref-run (virtual clock); the title menu is ready at ~8.1 s.
# title: Down x5 to Demo, Return (the demo starts at ~11.7 s)
@8500 key-down DOWN
@8560 key-up DOWN
@8800 key-down DOWN
@8860 key-up DOWN
@9100 key-down DOWN
@9160 key-up DOWN
@9400 key-down DOWN
@9460 key-up DOWN
@9700 key-down DOWN
@9760 key-up DOWN
@10000 key-down RETURN
@10060 key-up RETURN
